{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UAidP2VvrZDUQDs49vJ8ud","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — struct_self_consist_ie\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (via ARR May 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Deadline: ARR May cycle, 2026-05-25\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (2 条)\n9\t\n10\t### Claim 1 (Positive — NER)\n11\tFor entity-level information extraction, structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard over structured outputs) provides a significantly stronger confidence signal than surface agreement (Fleiss' Kappa), enabling effective test-time scaling through consistency-based sample selection.\n12\t\n13\t**MVP evidence**: NER rho_sj=0.388, SJ>FK +12pp (p=2e-20), oracle headroom +5.5pp.\n14\t\n15\t### Claim 2 (Diagnostic — RE + boundary condition)\n16\tThe effectiveness of consistency-based confidence is governed by task structural complexity: compound error propagation in relational tasks fundamentally degrades the consistency-accuracy correlation on the full instance set, but the signal remains valid within the model's capability range (conditional instances). This establishes a principled boundary for when structural consistency works as a TTS signal.\n17\t\n18\t**MVP evidence**: RE full rho_sj=0.234 (FAIL), RE cond rho_sj=0.372 (SJ>FK +11.8pp). Component decomposition (E1) shows all RE components equally weak (head_sj rho=0.210), ruling out metric design as cause. T=0.7 naturally separates knowledge-gap vs uncertainty errors.\n19\t\n20\t## Story Spine\n21\t\n22\t**Problem**: Test-time scaling (TTS) through sampling + selection requires a reliable confidence signal. Self-consistency has shown promise in reasoning tasks (majority voting), but structured prediction (IE) poses unique challenges: outputs have internal structure (entities, relations, triplets), and simple surface agreement ignores structural similarity.\n23\t\n24\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Self-consistency in LLM reasoning uses exact-match voting on final answers. For structured prediction, no systematic study exists on whether structural similarity between sampled outputs correlates with accuracy. Fleiss' Kappa measures surface agreement but treats structured outputs as flat tokens, missing structural information.\n25\t\n26\t**Our framing**: We introduce structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard) as a confidence signal for IE test-time scaling. Unlike prior work on reasoning self-consistency, we operate on structured outputs where the metric choice fundamentally matters. We discover a task-complexity boundary: structural consistency is a strong signal for entity-level tasks (NER) where errors are independent, but degrades for relational tasks (RE) where compound error propagation across head/tail/type components amplifies noise. This diagnostic finding provides practical guidance on when TTS works for structured prediction.\n27\t\n28\t**Headline result template**: \"On SciERC NER, structural self-consistency achieves rho=0.39 correlation with accuracy (vs rho=0.32 for Fleiss' Kappa, p<1e-19), enabling +X F1 improvement through best-of-N selection. However, on relation extraction, full-set correlation drops to rho=0.23 due to compound error propagation — though conditional analysis (within-capability instances) recovers rho=0.37 with SJ>FK by 12pp.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n31\t\n32\t### R1: \"Only one NER dataset — generalization unclear\"\n33\t- **Mitigation**: exp-002 (CoNLL-2003) + exp-003 (OntoNotes) validate cross-dataset\n34\t- **Priority**: P0, must address before submission\n35\t\n36\t### R2: \"Only one model family (Qwen3-8B)\"\n37\t- **Mitigation**: exp-007 (LLaMA-3.1-8B or similar) shows model-agnostic effect\n38\t- **Priority**: P1, strongly recommended\n39\t\n40\t### R3: \"RE negative result makes the contribution narrow\"\n41\t- **Mitigation**: Frame Claim 2 as diagnostic contribution — identifying WHY and WHEN consistency fails is as valuable as showing it works. Component decomposition + temperature sensitivity provide mechanistic explanation.\n42\t- **Priority**: Addressed by framing, reinforced by exp-004 (RE diagnostic analysis)\n43\t\n44\t### R4: \"No actual TTS improvement demonstrated\"\n45\t- **Mitigation**: exp-006 (adaptive compute demo) shows concrete F1 gains from SJ-based selection vs random vs FK\n46\t- **Priority**: P1, high impact\n47\t\n48\t### R5: \"Sample size N=8 may be too small for reliable SJ estimation\"\n49\t- **Mitigation**: exp-001 (N=16) tests scaling effect on NER; if rho improves, demonstrates N-sensitivity\n50\t- **Priority**: P0\n51\t\n52\t### R6: \"Conditional analysis cherry-picks favorable instances\"\n53\t- **Mitigation**: All-zero instances represent fundamental knowledge gaps (model consistently fails), not borderline cases. The separation is principled: consistency should measure uncertainty, not inability. Temperature analysis (T=0.7 increases all-zero count while improving conditional rho) supports this interpretation.\n54\t- **Priority**: Addressed by analysis in paper\n55\t\n56\t## Venue Fit\n57\t\n58\tEMNLP is well-suited for:\n59\t- NLP-focused analysis of IE methods\n60\t- Empirical studies with diagnostic findings\n61\t- Negative results that provide principled explanations\n62\t\n63\tRisk: purely analytical paper without a new method. Mitigation: structural self-consistency + the diagnostic framework ARE the methodological contributions; the findings provide actionable guidelines.\n64\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dea7b745-91ff-40c0-bed7-53cf0656c913","uuid":"0e1a79a7-96a9-4716-b8ee-f0317082f25c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:56:50.746Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T093336/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — struct_self_consist_ie\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (via ARR May 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Deadline: ARR May cycle, 2026-05-25\n\n## Core Claims (2 条)\n\n### Claim 1 (Positive — NER)\nFor entity-level information extraction, structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard over structured outputs) provides a significantly stronger confidence signal than surface agreement (Fleiss' Kappa), enabling effective test-time scaling through consistency-based sample selection.\n\n**MVP evidence**: NER rho_sj=0.388, SJ>FK +12pp (p=2e-20), oracle headroom +5.5pp.\n\n### Claim 2 (Diagnostic — RE + boundary condition)\nThe effectiveness of consistency-based confidence is governed by task structural complexity: compound error propagation in relational tasks fundamentally degrades the consistency-accuracy correlation on the full instance set, but the signal remains valid within the model's capability range (conditional instances). This establishes a principled boundary for when structural consistency works as a TTS signal.\n\n**MVP evidence**: RE full rho_sj=0.234 (FAIL), RE cond rho_sj=0.372 (SJ>FK +11.8pp). Component decomposition (E1) shows all RE components equally weak (head_sj rho=0.210), ruling out metric design as cause. T=0.7 naturally separates knowledge-gap vs uncertainty errors.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: Test-time scaling (TTS) through sampling + selection requires a reliable confidence signal. Self-consistency has shown promise in reasoning tasks (majority voting), but structured prediction (IE) poses unique challenges: outputs have internal structure (entities, relations, triplets), and simple surface agreement ignores structural similarity.\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Self-consistency in LLM reasoning uses exact-match voting on final answers. For structured prediction, no systematic study exists on whether structural similarity between sampled outputs correlates with accuracy. Fleiss' Kappa measures surface agreement but treats structured outputs as flat tokens, missing structural information.\n\n**Our framing**: We introduce structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard) as a confidence signal for IE test-time scaling. Unlike prior work on reasoning self-consistency, we operate on structured outputs where the metric choice fundamentally matters. We discover a task-complexity boundary: structural consistency is a strong signal for entity-level tasks (NER) where errors are independent, but degrades for relational tasks (RE) where compound error propagation across head/tail/type components amplifies noise. This diagnostic finding provides practical guidance on when TTS works for structured prediction.\n\n**Headline result template**: \"On SciERC NER, structural self-consistency achieves rho=0.39 correlation with accuracy (vs rho=0.32 for Fleiss' Kappa, p<1e-19), enabling +X F1 improvement through best-of-N selection. However, on relation extraction, full-set correlation drops to rho=0.23 due to compound error propagation — though conditional analysis (within-capability instances) recovers rho=0.37 with SJ>FK by 12pp.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### R1: \"Only one NER dataset — generalization unclear\"\n- **Mitigation**: exp-002 (CoNLL-2003) + exp-003 (OntoNotes) validate cross-dataset\n- **Priority**: P0, must address before submission\n\n### R2: \"Only one model family (Qwen3-8B)\"\n- **Mitigation**: exp-007 (LLaMA-3.1-8B or similar) shows model-agnostic effect\n- **Priority**: P1, strongly recommended\n\n### R3: \"RE negative result makes the contribution narrow\"\n- **Mitigation**: Frame Claim 2 as diagnostic contribution — identifying WHY and WHEN consistency fails is as valuable as showing it works. Component decomposition + temperature sensitivity provide mechanistic explanation.\n- **Priority**: Addressed by framing, reinforced by exp-004 (RE diagnostic analysis)\n\n### R4: \"No actual TTS improvement demonstrated\"\n- **Mitigation**: exp-006 (adaptive compute demo) shows concrete F1 gains from SJ-based selection vs random vs FK\n- **Priority**: P1, high impact\n\n### R5: \"Sample size N=8 may be too small for reliable SJ estimation\"\n- **Mitigation**: exp-001 (N=16) tests scaling effect on NER; if rho improves, demonstrates N-sensitivity\n- **Priority**: P0\n\n### R6: \"Conditional analysis cherry-picks favorable instances\"\n- **Mitigation**: All-zero instances represent fundamental knowledge gaps (model consistently fails), not borderline cases. The separation is principled: consistency should measure uncertainty, not inability. Temperature analysis (T=0.7 increases all-zero count while improving conditional rho) supports this interpretation.\n- **Priority**: Addressed by analysis in paper\n\n## Venue Fit\n\nEMNLP is well-suited for:\n- NLP-focused analysis of IE methods\n- Empirical studies with diagnostic findings\n- Negative results that provide principled explanations\n\nRisk: purely analytical paper without a new method. Mitigation: structural self-consistency + the diagnostic framework ARE the methodological contributions; the findings provide actionable guidelines.\n","numLines":64,"startLine":1,"totalLines":64}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T7jMHpSQqxSjJbxWUQm4Xk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"ner_n16_scierc\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"SciERC NER N=16 采样，测试 rho 是否突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.6671,\n7\t      \"oracle_f1_n16\": 0.789,\n8\t      \"headroom_n16\": 0.122,\n9\t      \"rho_sj_full_n16\": 0.41,\n10\t      \"rho_fk_full_n16\": 0.29,\n11\t      \"rho_sj_cond_n16\": 0.42,\n12\t      \"rho_fk_cond_n16\": 0.28,\n13\t      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.12,\n14\t      \"n_full\": 529,\n15\t      \"n_cond\": 509,\n16\t      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.612,\n17\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 11.5,\n18\t      \"p_sj_full\": 2.1e-22\n19\t    },\n20\t    \"tables\": [\n21\t      {\n22\t        \"name\": \"Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER\",\n23\t        \"columns\": [\n24\t          \"Metric\",\n25\t          \"N=8 (pilot_004)\",\n26\t          \"N=16\"\n27\t        ],\n28\t        \"rows\": [\n29\t          [\n30\t            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n31\t            0.3825,\n32\t            0.41\n33\t          ],\n34\t          [\n35\t            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n36\t            0.259,\n37\t            0.29\n38\t          ],\n39\t          [\n40\t            \"SJ - FK delta\",\n41\t            0.1235,\n42\t            0.12\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"Oracle F1\",\n46\t            0.7756,\n47\t            0.789\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"Headroom\",\n51\t            0.1085,\n52\t            0.122\n53\t          ],\n54\t          [\n55\t            \"Sample F1 mean\",\n56\t            0.6084,\n57\t            0.612\n58\t          ],\n59\t          [\n60\t            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n61\t            12.19,\n62\t            11.5\n63\t          ]\n64\t        ]\n65\t      }\n66\t    ],\n67\t    \"figures\": [],\n68\t    \"analysis\": \"rho=0.41 统计显著高于 0.38（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。N-scaling curve  在 N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。这限制了 \\\"more samples = better\\\"  的叙事。论文中应报告为 \\\"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing around N=16\\\"，而非  oversell 这个增量。\\n\\n\\nN=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（每个 instance 的 pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28 增至 C(16,2)=120）， 降低了 metric noise，使 rho 从 0.3825 小幅提升至 0.41。但提升幅度有限（+0.03），因为瓶颈不是 sample  count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖主要输出模式， 额外 8 个 samples 只补充了 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.109→0.122 说明 N=16 确实捕获了更多  diverse outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。这个 rho=0.41 够发 paper 但不 dramatic——reviewer 会  质疑 rho=0.41 vs 0.38 的 practical significance。\\n\"\n69\t  },\n70\t  {\n71\t    \"name\": \"ner_conll2003\",\n72\t    \"description\": \"CoNLL-2003 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\",\n73\t    \"results\": {\n74\t      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.745,\n75\t      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.065,\n76\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.723,\n77\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.821,\n78\t      \"headroom\": 0.098,\n79\t      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.37,\n80\t      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.3,\n81\t      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.07,\n82\t      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.38,\n83\t      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.29,\n84\t      \"n_full\": 3250,\n85\t      \"n_cond\": 3105,\n86\t      \"p_sj_full\": 1.8e-30,\n87\t      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.68,\n88\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 6.2\n89\t    },\n90\t    \"tables\": [\n91\t      {\n92\t        \"name\": \"Table: CoNLL-2003 NER consistency metrics\",\n93\t        \"columns\": [\n94\t          \"Metric\",\n95\t          \"SJ\",\n96\t          \"FK\"\n97\t        ],\n98\t        \"rows\": [\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"rho (full set)\",\n101\t            0.37,\n102\t            0.3\n103\t          ],\n104\t          [\n105\t            \"rho (conditional)\",\n106\t            0.38,\n107\t            0.29\n108\t          ],\n109\t          [\n110\t            \"p-value (full)\",\n111\t            \"1.8e-30\",\n112\t            \"4.2e-18\"\n113\t          ]\n114\t        ]\n115\t      }\n116\t    ],\n117\t    \"figures\": [],\n118\t    \"analysis\": \"CoNLL 复现了 SJ>FK 的核心发现，delta=7pp 与 SciERC 的 12pp 一致方向。rho 绝对值较低  可归因于 CoNLL 的 lower variance（task 更简单，less room for the metric to discriminate）。 论文中可以 confidently 报告 \\\"SJ advantage replicates on CoNLL-2003\\\"。\\n\\n\\nCoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的 SJ 信号： type confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary  更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单， 但 rho 反而只有 0.37（低于 SciERC 的 0.41），因为 higher baseline 意味着更多 instance  处于 ceiling（F1>0.9），这些 instance 的 SJ 和 F1 都高但贡献不到 rank correlation。 SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural metric 优势跨数据集成立。这是 \\\"好\\\" 的  跨数据集结果。N=3250（CoNLL test set 更大）提供极高统计功效。\\n\"\n119\t  },\n120\t  {\n121\t    \"name\": \"ner_ontonotes\",\n122\t    \"description\": \"OntoNotes 5.0 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\",\n123\t    \"results\": {\n124\t      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.618,\n125\t      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.092,\n126\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.583,\n127\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.685,\n128\t      \"headroom\": 0.102,\n129\t      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.29,\n130\t      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.26,\n131\t      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.03,\n132\t      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.31,\n133\t      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.27,\n134\t      \"n_full\": 8262,\n135\t      \"n_cond\": 7480,\n136\t      \"p_sj_full\": 3.1e-15,\n137\t      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.51,\n138\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 15.8\n139\t    },\n140\t    \"tables\": [\n141\t      {\n142\t        \"name\": \"Table: OntoNotes NER consistency metrics\",\n143\t        \"columns\": [\n144\t          \"Metric\",\n145\t          \"SJ\",\n146\t          \"FK\"\n147\t        ],\n148\t        \"rows\": [\n149\t          [\n150\t            \"rho (full set)\",\n151\t            0.29,\n152\t            0.26\n153\t          ],\n154\t          [\n155\t            \"rho (conditional)\",\n156\t            0.31,\n157\t            0.27\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"p-value (full)\",\n161\t            \"3.1e-15\",\n162\t            \"5.7e-12\"\n163\t          ]\n164\t        ]\n165\t      },\n166\t      {\n167\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-dataset comparison summary\",\n168\t        \"columns\": [\n169\t          \"Dataset\",\n170\t          \"#Types\",\n171\t          \"Greedy F1\",\n172\t          \"rho_sj\",\n173\t          \"SJ-FK delta\"\n174\t        ],\n175\t        \"rows\": [\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"SciERC\",\n178\t            6,\n179\t            0.667,\n180\t            0.41,\n181\t            \"+12pp\"\n182\t          ],\n183\t          [\n184\t            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n185\t            4,\n186\t            0.723,\n187\t            0.37,\n188\t            \"+7pp\"\n189\t          ],\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"OntoNotes\",\n192\t            18,\n193\t            0.583,\n194\t            0.29,\n195\t            \"+3pp\"\n196\t          ]\n197\t        ]\n198\t      }\n199\t    ],\n200\t    \"figures\": [],\n201\t    \"analysis\": \"OntoNotes 是必须正面面对的弱结果。叙事策略：将三个数据集排列为 type granularity 的 gradient  （4→6→18 types），分析 rho 随 type 数增加的下降趋势。论点：SJ 的优势在于捕捉 structural  overlap，但当 type confusion 成为主要 error source 时，structural overlap 不再是 accuracy  的 good proxy。这为 SJ 的适用条件提供了 principled 解释，将弱结果转化为 analytical contribution。 但 reviewer 仍可能指出只有 3 个数据点的 trend 不够 convincing。\\n\\n\\nOntoNotes 的 18 个 fine-grained entity types 严重削弱 SJ 信号。核心问题：type confusion  inflate SJ without reflecting accuracy。例如模型在不同 samples 中将同一 span 标为 GPE/LOC/FAC， SJ 看到 span overlap 给出中等分数，但 strict F1 全部判错。这种 \\\"structurally similar but  semantically wrong\\\" 的 pattern 在 SciERC（6 types）和 CoNLL（4 types）中影响小，在 OntoNotes 中  成为主要 noise source。rho=0.29 统计显著（p<1e-14，得益于大 test set），但 SJ>FK 仅 3pp， reviewer 会质疑 practical significance。这是叙事中的 \\\"弱\\\" 数据集，但正好提供了分析  \\\"what dataset properties affect SJ effectiveness\\\" 的素材。\\n\"\n202\t  },\n203\t  {\n204\t    \"name\": \"re_diagnostic_analysis\",\n205\t    \"description\": \"基于 pilot_004/005 数据的 per-relation-type consistency 分析\",\n206\t    \"results\": {\n207\t      \"per_type_rho_sj\": {\n208\t        \"Used-for\": 0.32,\n209\t        \"Feature-of\": 0.28,\n210\t        \"Hyponym-of\": 0.25,\n211\t        \"Part-of\": 0.18,\n212\t        \"Compare\": 0.15,\n213\t        \"Conjunction\": 0.21,\n214\t        \"Evaluate-for\": 0.22\n215\t      },\n216\t      \"per_type_n\": {\n217\t        \"Used-for\": 98,\n218\t        \"Feature-of\": 62,\n219\t        \"Hyponym-of\": 45,\n220\t        \"Part-of\": 38,\n221\t        \"Compare\": 32,\n222\t        \"Conjunction\": 51,\n223\t        \"Evaluate-for\": 71\n224\t      },\n225\t      \"max_type_rho\": 0.32,\n226\t      \"min_type_rho\": 0.15,\n227\t      \"correlation_type_freq_vs_rho\": 0.61,\n228\t      \"correlation_type_arity_vs_rho\": -0.34\n229\t    },\n230\t    \"tables\": [\n231\t      {\n232\t        \"name\": \"Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho on SciERC RE\",\n233\t        \"columns\": [\n234\t          \"Relation Type\",\n235\t          \"n\",\n236\t          \"rho_sj\",\n237\t          \"% all-zero\"\n238\t        ],\n239\t        \"rows\": [\n240\t          [\n241\t            \"Used-for\",\n242\t            98,\n243\t            0.32,\n244\t            35\n245\t          ],\n246\t          [\n247\t            \"Evaluate-for\",\n248\t            71,\n249\t            0.22,\n250\t            42\n251\t          ],\n252\t          [\n253\t            \"Feature-of\",\n254\t            62,\n255\t            0.28,\n256\t            40\n257\t          ],\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"Conjunction\",\n260\t            51,\n261\t            0.21,\n262\t            48\n263\t          ],\n264\t          [\n265\t            \"Hyponym-of\",\n266\t            45,\n267\t            0.25,\n268\t            52\n269\t          ],\n270\t          [\n271\t            \"Part-of\",\n272\t            38,\n273\t            0.18,\n274\t            58\n275\t          ],\n276\t          [\n277\t            \"Compare\",\n278\t            32,\n279\t            0.15,\n280\t            62\n281\t          ]\n282\t        ]\n283\t      }\n284\t    ],\n285\t    \"figures\": [],\n286\t    \"analysis\": \"分析方向对但 story 不够 clean。Type frequency 是 main predictor 但 R^2 只有 ~0.37， 需要补充 qualitative analysis（e.g. Compare 和 Part-of 是 inherently ambiguous types）。 论文中应呈现为 \\\"exploratory analysis suggesting frequency and type ambiguity as  moderating factors\\\"，不能 overclaim causal relationship。作为 diagnostic 的 supporting  evidence 足够，但不能独立支撑一个 sub-claim。\\n\\n\\nHigh-frequency types（Used-for, Feature-of）有更多 training examples 和 evaluation instances， model 对这些 type 的输出更稳定，SJ 估计也更 reliable，因此 rho 更高（0.28-0.32）。 Low-frequency types（Part-of, Compare）rho 极低（0.15-0.18），原因双重：(1) 模型对这些 type  本身 capability 差，大量 all-zero outputs 导致 SJ 无法区分 uncertainty vs inability； (2) sample size 小（n=32-38），rho 估计 noisy。整体 pattern 支持 \\\"compound error +  frequency\\\" 叙事但不够 crisp——type frequency 和 rho 的 correlation 只有 0.61，说明  frequency 不是唯一 driver。reviewer 会指出 confounds（type frequency 和 type inherent  difficulty 高度相关）。\\n\"\n287\t  },\n288\t  {\n289\t    \"name\": \"temperature_sensitivity_analysis\",\n290\t    \"description\": \"T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统比较（NER + RE），分析 signal-noise tradeoff\",\n291\t    \"results\": {\n292\t      \"ner_t10_rho_sj_full\": 0.3825,\n293\t      \"ner_t10_rho_sj_cond\": 0.3762,\n294\t      \"ner_t10_oracle_f1\": 0.7756,\n295\t      \"ner_t10_headroom\": 0.1085,\n296\t      \"ner_t10_pct_zero\": 12.19,\n297\t      \"ner_t07_rho_sj_full\": 0.39,\n298\t      \"ner_t07_rho_sj_cond\": 0.4,\n299\t      \"ner_t07_oracle_f1\": 0.755,\n300\t      \"ner_t07_headroom\": 0.088,\n301\t      \"ner_t07_pct_zero\": 9.5,\n302\t      \"re_t10_rho_sj_full\": 0.2441,\n303\t      \"re_t10_rho_sj_cond\": 0.3161,\n304\t      \"re_t10_pct_zero\": 44.3,\n305\t      \"re_t10_all_zero_filtered\": 84,\n306\t      \"re_t07_rho_sj_full\": 0.228,\n307\t      \"re_t07_rho_sj_cond\": 0.34,\n308\t      \"re_t07_pct_zero\": 51.2,\n309\t      \"re_t07_all_zero_filtered\": 105\n310\t    },\n311\t    \"tables\": [\n312\t      {\n313\t        \"name\": \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER)\",\n314\t        \"columns\": [\n315\t          \"Metric\",\n316\t          \"T=1.0\",\n317\t          \"T=0.7\",\n318\t          \"Delta\"\n319\t        ],\n320\t        \"rows\": [\n321\t          [\n322\t            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n323\t            0.3825,\n324\t            0.39,\n325\t            \"+0.008\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n329\t            0.3762,\n330\t            0.4,\n331\t            \"+0.024\"\n332\t          ],\n333\t          [\n334\t            \"Oracle F1\",\n335\t            0.7756,\n336\t            0.755,\n337\t            \"-0.021\"\n338\t          ],\n339\t          [\n340\t            \"Headroom\",\n341\t            0.1085,\n342\t            0.088,\n343\t            \"-0.021\"\n344\t          ],\n345\t          [\n346\t            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n347\t            12.19,\n348\t            9.5,\n349\t            \"-2.7\"\n350\t          ]\n351\t        ]\n352\t      },\n353\t      {\n354\t        \"name\": \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (RE)\",\n355\t        \"columns\": [\n356\t          \"Metric\",\n357\t          \"T=1.0\",\n358\t          \"T=0.7\",\n359\t          \"Delta\"\n360\t        ],\n361\t        \"rows\": [\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n364\t            0.2441,\n365\t            0.228,\n366\t            \"-0.016\"\n367\t          ],\n368\t          [\n369\t            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n370\t            0.3161,\n371\t            0.34,\n372\t            \"+0.024\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"All-zero instances\",\n376\t            84,\n377\t            105,\n378\t            \"+21\"\n379\t          ],\n380\t          [\n381\t            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n382\t            44.3,\n383\t            51.2,\n384\t            \"+6.9\"\n385\t          ]\n386\t        ]\n387\t      }\n388\t    ],\n389\t    \"figures\": [],\n390\t    \"analysis\": \"Signal-noise tradeoff 存在但 effect size 小。NER 上 T 选择几乎无关紧要（delta<0.01 on full rho）。 RE 上 conditional rho 的提升更 notable（+0.024），支持 \\\"T=0.7 helps separate uncertainty from  inability\\\" 的叙事。但 reviewer 会 argue 这只是 trivially 在做 threshold tuning。 论文中最好作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，不值得单独一个 section。主要 takeaway：T 的选择对 NER  影响小，对 RE 的 conditional analysis 有 moderate 影响，推荐 T=0.7 作为 default。\\n\\n\\nT=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER 在 T=0.7 下  rho 略高（0.39 vs 0.38），因为 lower T 减少了 random noise（fewer spurious entity  predictions），使 SJ 更 reflective of genuine structural agreement。但 oracle headroom  下降（0.088 vs 0.109），因为 samples 更 homogeneous，限制了 best-of-N 的上限。 RE 的 pattern 更极端：T=0.7 使 all-zero instances 增加（84→105），因为 lower T 让  model 更 decisively 输出 nothing（而非 T=1.0 下偶尔 hallucinate 出 relation）， 但 conditional set 的 rho 提升（0.316→0.34），说明 T=0.7 更好地 separates \\\"can't do\\\"  from \\\"uncertain\\\"。整体 effect 是 modest 的，reviewer 会认为 T 的选择是 hyperparameter  tuning 而非 insight。\\n\"\n391\t  },\n392\t  {\n393\t    \"name\": \"adaptive_compute_demo\",\n394\t    \"description\": \"NER TTS improvement demo：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy selection\",\n395\t    \"results\": {\n396\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.6671,\n397\t      \"sj_selection_f1\": 0.685,\n398\t      \"fk_selection_f1\": 0.677,\n399\t      \"random_selection_f1\": 0.674,\n400\t      \"oracle_selection_f1\": 0.789,\n401\t      \"sj_gain_over_greedy\": 1.8,\n402\t      \"fk_gain_over_greedy\": 1.0,\n403\t      \"random_gain_over_greedy\": 0.7,\n404\t      \"sj_headroom_capture_pct\": 14.8,\n405\t      \"fk_headroom_capture_pct\": 8.2,\n406\t      \"sj_vs_fk_gain\": 0.8\n407\t    },\n408\t    \"tables\": [\n409\t      {\n410\t        \"name\": \"Table: Adaptive compute comparison on SciERC NER (N=16)\",\n411\t        \"columns\": [\n412\t          \"Strategy\",\n413\t          \"F1\",\n414\t          \"Gain vs Greedy\",\n415\t          \"% Oracle Headroom\"\n416\t        ],\n417\t        \"rows\": [\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"Greedy (T=0)\",\n420\t            0.6671,\n421\t            \"—\",\n422\t            \"—\"\n423\t          ],\n424\t          [\n425\t            \"Random sample\",\n426\t            0.674,\n427\t            \"+0.7pp\",\n428\t            \"5.7%\"\n429\t          ],\n430\t          [\n431\t            \"FK selection\",\n432\t            0.677,\n433\t            \"+1.0pp\",\n434\t            \"8.2%\"\n435\t          ],\n436\t          [\n437\t            \"SJ selection\",\n438\t            0.685,\n439\t            \"+1.8pp\",\n440\t            \"14.8%\"\n441\t          ],\n442\t          [\n443\t            \"Oracle\",\n444\t            0.789,\n445\t            \"+12.2pp\",\n446\t            \"100%\"\n447\t          ]\n448\t        ]\n449\t      }\n450\t    ],\n451\t    \"figures\": [],\n452\t    \"analysis\": \"+1.8pp 是 technically solid 但叙事上不够 compelling 作为 headline result。14.8% 的 oracle  headroom capture 说明 SJ 作为 selection signal 还远不够好——85% 的潜力未被利用。论文中  应 frame 为 \\\"SJ provides modest but consistent improvement over baselines, suggesting  room for better consistency metrics\\\"。作为 supporting experiment 有说服力，但不能 carry  the paper。如果 reviewer R4 质疑 \\\"no actual TTS improvement\\\"，+1.8pp 的回答只是 marginal  satisfactory。\\n\\n\\nSJ-based selection 的 +1.8pp gain 源自 rho=0.41 的不完美 ranking：SJ 能识别出 roughly 15%  的 oracle headroom。这个 gain 是 real 但 modest 的原因：(1) rho=0.41 意味着 SJ ranking  和 actual accuracy ranking 只有 moderate agreement；(2) 很多 high-SJ instance 本身已经接近  greedy performance（ceiling effect）；(3) low-SJ instance 中确实有 bad samples 但 greedy  就是比任何 sample 好（model confidence 准确时 greedy > stochastic）。FK 的 +1.0pp 更弱， 因为 FK 的 lower rho（0.29）意味着更差的 ranking ability。SJ>FK gain 仅 0.8pp， reviewer 会质疑这是否 justify 使用更复杂的 structured metric。\\n\"\n453\t  },\n454\t  {\n455\t    \"name\": \"ner_multi_model\",\n456\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC NER，验证 effect 跨模型泛化\",\n457\t    \"results\": {\n458\t      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.635,\n459\t      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.088,\n460\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.601,\n461\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.748,\n462\t      \"headroom\": 0.147,\n463\t      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.35,\n464\t      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.28,\n465\t      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.07,\n466\t      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.36,\n467\t      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.27,\n468\t      \"n_full\": 529,\n469\t      \"n_cond\": 495,\n470\t      \"p_sj_full\": 8.4e-17,\n471\t      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.52,\n472\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 16.3\n473\t    },\n474\t    \"tables\": [\n475\t      {\n476\t        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)\",\n477\t        \"columns\": [\n478\t          \"Metric\",\n479\t          \"Qwen3-8B\",\n480\t          \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\"\n481\t        ],\n482\t        \"rows\": [\n483\t          [\n484\t            \"Greedy F1\",\n485\t            0.667,\n486\t            0.601\n487\t          ],\n488\t          [\n489\t            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n490\t            0.41,\n491\t            0.35\n492\t          ],\n493\t          [\n494\t            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n495\t            0.29,\n496\t            0.28\n497\t          ],\n498\t          [\n499\t            \"SJ - FK delta\",\n500\t            \"+12pp\",\n501\t            \"+7pp\"\n502\t          ],\n503\t          [\n504\t            \"Oracle F1\",\n505\t            0.789,\n506\t            0.748\n507\t          ],\n508\t          [\n509\t            \"Headroom\",\n510\t            0.122,\n511\t            0.147\n512\t          ]\n513\t        ]\n514\t      }\n515\t    ],\n516\t    \"figures\": [],\n517\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 concern 但不是 strong refutation。SJ>FK 的方向一致  是 positive signal，但 delta 从 12→7pp 和 rho 从 0.41→0.35 的下降留下了 \\\"效果  是否 robust across stronger/weaker models\\\" 的疑问。如果有 budget，加一个 70B model  或 GPT-4-class model 会更有说服力，但 P1 优先级下 8B-class 两个 model 是合理 scope。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 比 Qwen3-8B 弱（greedy F1 0.60 vs 0.67），因为  LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力不如 Qwen3。rho_sj=0.35  低于 Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK 的 advantage 依然显著（+7pp），说明 \\\"structural metric  优于 surface metric\\\" 这个 finding 是 model-agnostic 的。rho 较低的原因：LLaMA 的  lower baseline performance 意味着更多 instance 处于 \\\"inability\\\" 区间（all-zero 比例  更高），这些 instance dilute 了 overall correlation。SJ>FK delta 从 12pp 降至 7pp  也符合预期：weaker model 的 output 更 noisy，SJ 的 structural sensitivity 优势被  noise 部分抵消。作为 model-agnosticism 的 evidence 是 sufficient 但不 compelling。\\n\"\n518\t  },\n519\t  {\n520\t    \"name\": \"re_n16_confirmation\",\n521\t    \"description\": \"RE N=16 on SciERC 确认 negative finding\",\n522\t    \"results\": {\n523\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.4208,\n524\t      \"oracle_f1_n16\": 0.625,\n525\t      \"headroom_n16\": 0.204,\n526\t      \"rho_sj_full_n16\": 0.26,\n527\t      \"rho_fk_full_n16\": 0.29,\n528\t      \"rho_sj_cond_n16\": 0.33,\n529\t      \"rho_fk_cond_n16\": 0.3,\n530\t      \"sj_beats_fk_full\": false,\n531\t      \"sj_beats_fk_cond\": true,\n532\t      \"n_full\": 397,\n533\t      \"n_cond\": 305,\n534\t      \"all_zero_count\": 92,\n535\t      \"pct_zero_samples\": 42.1\n536\t    },\n537\t    \"tables\": [\n538\t      {\n539\t        \"name\": \"Table: RE N-scaling comparison on SciERC\",\n540\t        \"columns\": [\n541\t          \"Metric\",\n542\t          \"N=8 (pilot_004)\",\n543\t          \"N=16\"\n544\t        ],\n545\t        \"rows\": [\n546\t          [\n547\t            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n548\t            0.2441,\n549\t            0.26\n550\t          ],\n551\t          [\n552\t            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n553\t            0.2782,\n554\t            0.29\n555\t          ],\n556\t          [\n557\t            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n558\t            0.3161,\n559\t            0.33\n560\t          ],\n561\t          [\n562\t            \"rho_fk (cond)\",\n563\t            0.3067,\n564\t            0.3\n565\t          ],\n566\t          [\n567\t            \"SJ beats FK (full)\",\n568\t            \"No\",\n569\t            \"No\"\n570\t          ],\n571\t          [\n572\t            \"SJ beats FK (cond)\",\n573\t            \"Yes\",\n574\t            \"Yes\"\n575\t          ],\n576\t          [\n577\t            \"All-zero instances\",\n578\t            84,\n579\t            92\n580\t          ]\n581\t        ]\n582\t      }\n583\t    ],\n584\t    \"figures\": [],\n585\t    \"analysis\": \"RE N=16 的 marginal improvement 完美 confirms Claim 2：compound error propagation  是 structural bottleneck，不是 sample size problem。论文中可以直接写 \\\"increasing N  from 8 to 16 yields negligible improvement in RE full-set correlation (+0.016),  confirming that the degradation is fundamental rather than statistical\\\"。 Conditional rho=0.33 is a valid but modest signal，需要 caveat about threshold sensitivity。\\n\\n\\nRE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.26 vs N=8 的 0.244，提升极小（+0.016），因为 RE 的 fundamental  problem（compound error propagation）不会因为 more samples 而缓解——16 个 samples 产生的  span-level SJ 仍然无法区分 \\\"model 不确定 head entity\\\" vs \\\"model 不确定 relation type\\\"  vs \\\"model 根本不知道这个 relation\\\"。Conditional rho=0.33 在 median range 内（[0.28, 0.36]）， 比 N=8 的 0.316 略好，但 \\\"fuzzy boundary\\\" 的 caveat 明显——conditional set 的划分依赖  all-zero threshold，不同 threshold 会得到不同结果。SJ 在 full set 仍然输给 FK（0.26 vs 0.29）， 而 conditional set 上 SJ 小幅领先（0.33 vs 0.30），这个 pattern 与 N=8 一致， confirms the diagnostic finding with higher statistical power。\\n\"\n586\t  },\n587\t  {\n588\t    \"name\": \"capability_stratification\",\n589\t    \"description\": \"按 difficulty strata 分析 rho 变化（NER + RE）\",\n590\t    \"results\": {\n591\t      \"ner_strata\": {\n592\t        \"high_f1_gt_08\": {\n593\t          \"n\": 185,\n594\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.14\n595\t        },\n596\t        \"medium_f1_04_08\": {\n597\t          \"n\": 212,\n598\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.44\n599\t        },\n600\t        \"low_f1_lt_04\": {\n601\t          \"n\": 132,\n602\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.22\n603\t        }\n604\t      },\n605\t      \"re_strata\": {\n606\t        \"high_f1_gt_06\": {\n607\t          \"n\": 88,\n608\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.12\n609\t        },\n610\t        \"medium_f1_02_06\": {\n611\t          \"n\": 135,\n612\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.31\n613\t        },\n614\t        \"low_f1_lt_02\": {\n615\t          \"n\": 174,\n616\t          \"rho_sj\": 0.16\n617\t        }\n618\t      },\n619\t      \"ner_peak_stratum\": \"medium (0.4-0.8)\",\n620\t      \"re_peak_stratum\": \"medium (0.2-0.6)\",\n621\t      \"boundary_sharpness\": \"fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\"\n622\t    },\n623\t    \"tables\": [\n624\t      {\n625\t        \"name\": \"Table: NER rho_sj by difficulty stratum\",\n626\t        \"columns\": [\n627\t          \"Stratum\",\n628\t          \"F1 range\",\n629\t          \"n\",\n630\t          \"rho_sj\",\n631\t          \"95% CI\"\n632\t        ],\n633\t        \"rows\": [\n634\t          [\n635\t            \"Easy\",\n636\t            \">0.8\",\n637\t            185,\n638\t            0.14,\n639\t            \"[0.02, 0.26]\"\n640\t          ],\n641\t          [\n642\t            \"Medium\",\n643\t            \"0.4-0.8\",\n644\t            212,\n645\t            0.44,\n646\t            \"[0.33, 0.54]\"\n647\t          ],\n648\t          [\n649\t            \"Hard\",\n650\t            \"<0.4\",\n651\t            132,\n652\t            0.22,\n653\t            \"[0.06, 0.38]\"\n654\t          ]\n655\t        ]\n656\t      },\n657\t      {\n658\t        \"name\": \"Table: RE rho_sj by difficulty stratum\",\n659\t        \"columns\": [\n660\t          \"Stratum\",\n661\t          \"F1 range\",\n662\t          \"n\",\n663\t          \"rho_sj\",\n664\t          \"95% CI\"\n665\t        ],\n666\t        \"rows\": [\n667\t          [\n668\t            \"Easy\",\n669\t            \">0.6\",\n670\t            88,\n671\t            0.12,\n672\t            \"[-0.09, 0.32]\"\n673\t          ],\n674\t          [\n675\t            \"Medium\",\n676\t            \"0.2-0.6\",\n677\t            135,\n678\t            0.31,\n679\t            \"[0.16, 0.45]\"\n680\t          ],\n681\t          [\n682\t            \"Hard\",\n683\t            \"<0.2\",\n684\t            174,\n685\t            0.16,\n686\t            \"[0.02, 0.30]\"\n687\t          ]\n688\t        ]\n689\t      }\n690\t    ],\n691\t    \"figures\": [],\n692\t    \"analysis\": \"Inverted-U pattern 是 strongest analytical finding：明确解释了 \\\"为什么 overall rho 只有  0.41——因为 easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\\\"。Medium stratum 的 rho=0.44（NER） 说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上的 discriminative power 是合理的。但 fuzzy boundaries 限制了  practical guidance 的 precision——论文不能说 \\\"只在 F1 0.4-0.8 的 instance 上用 SJ\\\"， 因为 you don't know F1 at test time。这个分析是 diagnostic contribution 的核心， 但需要 honest framing about the boundary fuzziness。\\n\\n\\nrho 呈现 inverted-U 形状的原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ 都高且 variance 低， ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异；Low stratum（hard instances）的 model 基本 fail， SJ 接近 random，无 discriminative power。只有 Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance 和  genuine uncertainty，使 SJ 能 discriminate。但在 median tier 下 boundary 是 fuzzy 的： strata 之间的 rho CI 大幅重叠（bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。 RE 的 pattern 更极端——Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental  限制。这支持 Claim 2 但需要 \\\"the boundary is fuzzy\\\" 的 caveat。\\n\"\n693\t  },\n694\t  {\n695\t    \"name\": \"selection_curves\",\n696\t    \"description\": \"Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) for SJ vs FK vs random\",\n697\t    \"results\": {\n698\t      \"curves_sj\": {\n699\t        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n700\t        \"n2\": 0.672,\n701\t        \"n4\": 0.678,\n702\t        \"n8\": 0.683,\n703\t        \"n16\": 0.685\n704\t      },\n705\t      \"curves_fk\": {\n706\t        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n707\t        \"n2\": 0.67,\n708\t        \"n4\": 0.674,\n709\t        \"n8\": 0.676,\n710\t        \"n16\": 0.677\n711\t      },\n712\t      \"curves_rand\": {\n713\t        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n714\t        \"n2\": 0.669,\n715\t        \"n4\": 0.671,\n716\t        \"n8\": 0.673,\n717\t        \"n16\": 0.674\n718\t      },\n719\t      \"curves_oracle\": {\n720\t        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n721\t        \"n2\": 0.71,\n722\t        \"n4\": 0.745,\n723\t        \"n8\": 0.776,\n724\t        \"n16\": 0.789\n725\t      },\n726\t      \"sj_fk_gap_at_n16\": 0.008,\n727\t      \"sj_fk_gap_at_n8\": 0.007\n728\t    },\n729\t    \"tables\": [],\n730\t    \"figures\": [],\n731\t    \"analysis\": \"这张图的问题是 SJ/FK/random 三条线 visually 太接近，只有 inset/zoom 才能看到差异。 Oracle curve 远在上方，强调了 selection 的 headroom 还很大。最佳 framing： \\\"SJ consistently outperforms alternatives, but current correlation levels limit headroom  capture to ~15%\\\"。作为 P2 visualization，informative 但不 critical for acceptance。\\n\\n\\nSelection curves 显示 SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform FK 和 random，但 gap  modest：N=16 时 SJ vs FK 仅 0.8pp。Curves 都呈现 diminishing returns，与 oracle curve  的 gap 在 N 增大时反而 widen——说明 more samples 主要增加了 oracle ceiling（more diverse  outputs to choose from），但 SJ 的 selection ability 没有 proportionally 提升。 SJ-FK gap 随 N 微增（从 N=4 的 0.4pp 到 N=16 的 0.8pp），因为 more samples 让 SJ  的 structural comparison 更 stable。\\n\"\n732\t  },\n733\t  {\n734\t    \"name\": \"ner_ood_robustness\",\n735\t    \"description\": \"OntoNotes 域内 vs 域外 NER consistency signal 鲁棒性\",\n736\t    \"results\": {\n737\t      \"in_domain_rho_sj\": 0.29,\n738\t      \"ood_rho_sj\": 0.24,\n739\t      \"in_domain_greedy_f1\": 0.583,\n740\t      \"ood_greedy_f1\": 0.51,\n741\t      \"ood_sj_minus_fk\": 0.02,\n742\t      \"ood_rho_fk\": 0.22,\n743\t      \"ood_n\": \"~1200\",\n744\t      \"ood_pct_zero\": 22.5\n745\t    },\n746\t    \"tables\": [\n747\t      {\n748\t        \"name\": \"Table: In-domain vs OOD on OntoNotes NER\",\n749\t        \"columns\": [\n750\t          \"Setting\",\n751\t          \"Greedy F1\",\n752\t          \"rho_sj\",\n753\t          \"rho_fk\",\n754\t          \"SJ-FK\"\n755\t        ],\n756\t        \"rows\": [\n757\t          [\n758\t            \"In-domain (nw)\",\n759\t            0.583,\n760\t            0.29,\n761\t            0.26,\n762\t            \"+3pp\"\n763\t          ],\n764\t          [\n765\t            \"OOD (bc/wb)\",\n766\t            0.51,\n767\t            0.24,\n768\t            0.22,\n769\t            \"+2pp\"\n770\t          ]\n771\t        ]\n772\t      }\n773\t    ],\n774\t    \"figures\": [],\n775\t    \"analysis\": \"OOD 结果是 median tier 的 additional risk factor。与 OntoNotes in-domain 的弱结果叠加， 叙事被进一步压缩。但也提供了额外 analysis angle：systematic vs random error 对 consistency  signal 的不同影响。论文中作为 \\\"limitations & future work\\\" section 的 content 是 appropriate， 但不能作为 positive contribution。P2 优先级下如果时间紧可以 cut。\\n\\nOOD 的 rho 从 in-domain 的 0.29 降至 0.24，因为 domain shift 引入了 systematic error  pattern 而非 random uncertainty——model 在 OOD domain 上 consistently 犯同类错误（e.g.,  新闻训练的 model 在 broadcast/weblog 上 systematically miss informal entity mentions）， 这种 systematic error 产生 high consistency（samples 一致地错）但 low accuracy， 破坏了 SJ-accuracy correlation。SJ>FK 仅 2pp，在 practical 意义上可忽略。 这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：不仅受 type granularity 影响，还受 domain match 影响。\\n\"\n776\t  }\n777\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dea7b745-91ff-40c0-bed7-53cf0656c913","uuid":"3b998083-eab4-409a-b21e-1c4af09ca318","timestamp":"2026-05-14T09:56:51.073Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T093336/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ner_n16_scierc\",\n    \"description\": \"SciERC NER N=16 采样，测试 rho 是否突破 0.40 并提供 N-scaling 数据\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.6671,\n      \"oracle_f1_n16\": 0.789,\n      \"headroom_n16\": 0.122,\n      \"rho_sj_full_n16\": 0.41,\n      \"rho_fk_full_n16\": 0.29,\n      \"rho_sj_cond_n16\": 0.42,\n      \"rho_fk_cond_n16\": 0.28,\n      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.12,\n      \"n_full\": 529,\n      \"n_cond\": 509,\n      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.612,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 11.5,\n      \"p_sj_full\": 2.1e-22\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: N-scaling comparison on SciERC NER\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"N=8 (pilot_004)\",\n          \"N=16\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n            0.3825,\n            0.41\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n            0.259,\n            0.29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ - FK delta\",\n            0.1235,\n            0.12\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle F1\",\n            0.7756,\n            0.789\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Headroom\",\n            0.1085,\n            0.122\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Sample F1 mean\",\n            0.6084,\n            0.612\n          ],\n          [\n            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n            12.19,\n            11.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"rho=0.41 统计显著高于 0.38（bootstrap CI 不重叠），但 effect size 不大。N-scaling curve  在 N=8 后明显趋平，暗示 T=0.7 下 N=16 接近 saturation。这限制了 \\\"more samples = better\\\"  的叙事。论文中应报告为 \\\"rho improves modestly with N, plateauing around N=16\\\"，而非  oversell 这个增量。\\n\\n\\nN=8→N=16 提供更稳定的 SJ 估计（每个 instance 的 pairwise comparison 从 C(8,2)=28 增至 C(16,2)=120）， 降低了 metric noise，使 rho 从 0.3825 小幅提升至 0.41。但提升幅度有限（+0.03），因为瓶颈不是 sample  count 而是 T=0.7 下模型的固有 diversity 上限——多数 instance 在 8 samples 时已充分覆盖主要输出模式， 额外 8 个 samples 只补充了 tail modes。Oracle headroom 从 0.109→0.122 说明 N=16 确实捕获了更多  diverse outputs，但 diminishing returns 明显。这个 rho=0.41 够发 paper 但不 dramatic——reviewer 会  质疑 rho=0.41 vs 0.38 的 practical significance。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ner_conll2003\",\n    \"description\": \"CoNLL-2003 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.745,\n      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.065,\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.723,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.821,\n      \"headroom\": 0.098,\n      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.37,\n      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.3,\n      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.07,\n      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.38,\n      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.29,\n      \"n_full\": 3250,\n      \"n_cond\": 3105,\n      \"p_sj_full\": 1.8e-30,\n      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.68,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 6.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: CoNLL-2003 NER consistency metrics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"SJ\",\n          \"FK\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho (full set)\",\n            0.37,\n            0.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho (conditional)\",\n            0.38,\n            0.29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"p-value (full)\",\n            \"1.8e-30\",\n            \"4.2e-18\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CoNLL 复现了 SJ>FK 的核心发现，delta=7pp 与 SciERC 的 12pp 一致方向。rho 绝对值较低  可归因于 CoNLL 的 lower variance（task 更简单，less room for the metric to discriminate）。 论文中可以 confidently 报告 \\\"SJ advantage replicates on CoNLL-2003\\\"。\\n\\n\\nCoNLL-2003 的 4 个粗粒度 entity type（PER/LOC/ORG/MISC）产生更 clean 的 SJ 信号： type confusion 少（PER 和 LOC 混淆概率远低于 SciERC 的 Method/Task 混淆），entity boundary  更清晰（新闻文本 vs 科学摘要）。模型 baseline F1 更高（0.72 vs 0.67）说明任务更简单， 但 rho 反而只有 0.37（低于 SciERC 的 0.41），因为 higher baseline 意味着更多 instance  处于 ceiling（F1>0.9），这些 instance 的 SJ 和 F1 都高但贡献不到 rank correlation。 SJ>FK +7pp 是 solid result，证明 structural metric 优势跨数据集成立。这是 \\\"好\\\" 的  跨数据集结果。N=3250（CoNLL test set 更大）提供极高统计功效。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ner_ontonotes\",\n    \"description\": \"OntoNotes 5.0 NER 跨数据集验证（fine-tune + N=8 pilot）\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.618,\n      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.092,\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.583,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.685,\n      \"headroom\": 0.102,\n      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.29,\n      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.26,\n      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.03,\n      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.31,\n      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.27,\n      \"n_full\": 8262,\n      \"n_cond\": 7480,\n      \"p_sj_full\": 3.1e-15,\n      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.51,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 15.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: OntoNotes NER consistency metrics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"SJ\",\n          \"FK\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho (full set)\",\n            0.29,\n            0.26\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho (conditional)\",\n            0.31,\n            0.27\n          ],\n          [\n            \"p-value (full)\",\n            \"3.1e-15\",\n            \"5.7e-12\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-dataset comparison summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dataset\",\n          \"#Types\",\n          \"Greedy F1\",\n          \"rho_sj\",\n          \"SJ-FK delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SciERC\",\n            6,\n            0.667,\n            0.41,\n            \"+12pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n            4,\n            0.723,\n            0.37,\n            \"+7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OntoNotes\",\n            18,\n            0.583,\n            0.29,\n            \"+3pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OntoNotes 是必须正面面对的弱结果。叙事策略：将三个数据集排列为 type granularity 的 gradient  （4→6→18 types），分析 rho 随 type 数增加的下降趋势。论点：SJ 的优势在于捕捉 structural  overlap，但当 type confusion 成为主要 error source 时，structural overlap 不再是 accuracy  的 good proxy。这为 SJ 的适用条件提供了 principled 解释，将弱结果转化为 analytical contribution。 但 reviewer 仍可能指出只有 3 个数据点的 trend 不够 convincing。\\n\\n\\nOntoNotes 的 18 个 fine-grained entity types 严重削弱 SJ 信号。核心问题：type confusion  inflate SJ without reflecting accuracy。例如模型在不同 samples 中将同一 span 标为 GPE/LOC/FAC， SJ 看到 span overlap 给出中等分数，但 strict F1 全部判错。这种 \\\"structurally similar but  semantically wrong\\\" 的 pattern 在 SciERC（6 types）和 CoNLL（4 types）中影响小，在 OntoNotes 中  成为主要 noise source。rho=0.29 统计显著（p<1e-14，得益于大 test set），但 SJ>FK 仅 3pp， reviewer 会质疑 practical significance。这是叙事中的 \\\"弱\\\" 数据集，但正好提供了分析  \\\"what dataset properties affect SJ effectiveness\\\" 的素材。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"re_diagnostic_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"基于 pilot_004/005 数据的 per-relation-type consistency 分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"per_type_rho_sj\": {\n        \"Used-for\": 0.32,\n        \"Feature-of\": 0.28,\n        \"Hyponym-of\": 0.25,\n        \"Part-of\": 0.18,\n        \"Compare\": 0.15,\n        \"Conjunction\": 0.21,\n        \"Evaluate-for\": 0.22\n      },\n      \"per_type_n\": {\n        \"Used-for\": 98,\n        \"Feature-of\": 62,\n        \"Hyponym-of\": 45,\n        \"Part-of\": 38,\n        \"Compare\": 32,\n        \"Conjunction\": 51,\n        \"Evaluate-for\": 71\n      },\n      \"max_type_rho\": 0.32,\n      \"min_type_rho\": 0.15,\n      \"correlation_type_freq_vs_rho\": 0.61,\n      \"correlation_type_arity_vs_rho\": -0.34\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Per-relation-type SJ rho on SciERC RE\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Relation Type\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"rho_sj\",\n          \"% all-zero\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Used-for\",\n            98,\n            0.32,\n            35\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Evaluate-for\",\n            71,\n            0.22,\n            42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Feature-of\",\n            62,\n            0.28,\n            40\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Conjunction\",\n            51,\n            0.21,\n            48\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hyponym-of\",\n            45,\n            0.25,\n            52\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Part-of\",\n            38,\n            0.18,\n            58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Compare\",\n            32,\n            0.15,\n            62\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"分析方向对但 story 不够 clean。Type frequency 是 main predictor 但 R^2 只有 ~0.37， 需要补充 qualitative analysis（e.g. Compare 和 Part-of 是 inherently ambiguous types）。 论文中应呈现为 \\\"exploratory analysis suggesting frequency and type ambiguity as  moderating factors\\\"，不能 overclaim causal relationship。作为 diagnostic 的 supporting  evidence 足够，但不能独立支撑一个 sub-claim。\\n\\n\\nHigh-frequency types（Used-for, Feature-of）有更多 training examples 和 evaluation instances， model 对这些 type 的输出更稳定，SJ 估计也更 reliable，因此 rho 更高（0.28-0.32）。 Low-frequency types（Part-of, Compare）rho 极低（0.15-0.18），原因双重：(1) 模型对这些 type  本身 capability 差，大量 all-zero outputs 导致 SJ 无法区分 uncertainty vs inability； (2) sample size 小（n=32-38），rho 估计 noisy。整体 pattern 支持 \\\"compound error +  frequency\\\" 叙事但不够 crisp——type frequency 和 rho 的 correlation 只有 0.61，说明  frequency 不是唯一 driver。reviewer 会指出 confounds（type frequency 和 type inherent  difficulty 高度相关）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"temperature_sensitivity_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"T=0.7 vs T=1.0 系统比较（NER + RE），分析 signal-noise tradeoff\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ner_t10_rho_sj_full\": 0.3825,\n      \"ner_t10_rho_sj_cond\": 0.3762,\n      \"ner_t10_oracle_f1\": 0.7756,\n      \"ner_t10_headroom\": 0.1085,\n      \"ner_t10_pct_zero\": 12.19,\n      \"ner_t07_rho_sj_full\": 0.39,\n      \"ner_t07_rho_sj_cond\": 0.4,\n      \"ner_t07_oracle_f1\": 0.755,\n      \"ner_t07_headroom\": 0.088,\n      \"ner_t07_pct_zero\": 9.5,\n      \"re_t10_rho_sj_full\": 0.2441,\n      \"re_t10_rho_sj_cond\": 0.3161,\n      \"re_t10_pct_zero\": 44.3,\n      \"re_t10_all_zero_filtered\": 84,\n      \"re_t07_rho_sj_full\": 0.228,\n      \"re_t07_rho_sj_cond\": 0.34,\n      \"re_t07_pct_zero\": 51.2,\n      \"re_t07_all_zero_filtered\": 105\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (NER)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"T=1.0\",\n          \"T=0.7\",\n          \"Delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n            0.3825,\n            0.39,\n            \"+0.008\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n            0.3762,\n            0.4,\n            \"+0.024\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle F1\",\n            0.7756,\n            0.755,\n            \"-0.021\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Headroom\",\n            0.1085,\n            0.088,\n            \"-0.021\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n            12.19,\n            9.5,\n            \"-2.7\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Temperature sensitivity (RE)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"T=1.0\",\n          \"T=0.7\",\n          \"Delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n            0.2441,\n            0.228,\n            \"-0.016\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n            0.3161,\n            0.34,\n            \"+0.024\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"All-zero instances\",\n            84,\n            105,\n            \"+21\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"% F1=0 samples\",\n            44.3,\n            51.2,\n            \"+6.9\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Signal-noise tradeoff 存在但 effect size 小。NER 上 T 选择几乎无关紧要（delta<0.01 on full rho）。 RE 上 conditional rho 的提升更 notable（+0.024），支持 \\\"T=0.7 helps separate uncertainty from  inability\\\" 的叙事。但 reviewer 会 argue 这只是 trivially 在做 threshold tuning。 论文中最好作为 1-2 段 analysis 呈现，不值得单独一个 section。主要 takeaway：T 的选择对 NER  影响小，对 RE 的 conditional analysis 有 moderate 影响，推荐 T=0.7 作为 default。\\n\\n\\nT=0.7 vs T=1.0 的 tradeoff 是 signal quality vs output diversity。NER 在 T=0.7 下  rho 略高（0.39 vs 0.38），因为 lower T 减少了 random noise（fewer spurious entity  predictions），使 SJ 更 reflective of genuine structural agreement。但 oracle headroom  下降（0.088 vs 0.109），因为 samples 更 homogeneous，限制了 best-of-N 的上限。 RE 的 pattern 更极端：T=0.7 使 all-zero instances 增加（84→105），因为 lower T 让  model 更 decisively 输出 nothing（而非 T=1.0 下偶尔 hallucinate 出 relation）， 但 conditional set 的 rho 提升（0.316→0.34），说明 T=0.7 更好地 separates \\\"can't do\\\"  from \\\"uncertain\\\"。整体 effect 是 modest 的，reviewer 会认为 T 的选择是 hyperparameter  tuning 而非 insight。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"adaptive_compute_demo\",\n    \"description\": \"NER TTS improvement demo：SJ vs FK vs random vs greedy selection\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.6671,\n      \"sj_selection_f1\": 0.685,\n      \"fk_selection_f1\": 0.677,\n      \"random_selection_f1\": 0.674,\n      \"oracle_selection_f1\": 0.789,\n      \"sj_gain_over_greedy\": 1.8,\n      \"fk_gain_over_greedy\": 1.0,\n      \"random_gain_over_greedy\": 0.7,\n      \"sj_headroom_capture_pct\": 14.8,\n      \"fk_headroom_capture_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"sj_vs_fk_gain\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Adaptive compute comparison on SciERC NER (N=16)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"F1\",\n          \"Gain vs Greedy\",\n          \"% Oracle Headroom\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Greedy (T=0)\",\n            0.6671,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random sample\",\n            0.674,\n            \"+0.7pp\",\n            \"5.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK selection\",\n            0.677,\n            \"+1.0pp\",\n            \"8.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ selection\",\n            0.685,\n            \"+1.8pp\",\n            \"14.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle\",\n            0.789,\n            \"+12.2pp\",\n            \"100%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"+1.8pp 是 technically solid 但叙事上不够 compelling 作为 headline result。14.8% 的 oracle  headroom capture 说明 SJ 作为 selection signal 还远不够好——85% 的潜力未被利用。论文中  应 frame 为 \\\"SJ provides modest but consistent improvement over baselines, suggesting  room for better consistency metrics\\\"。作为 supporting experiment 有说服力，但不能 carry  the paper。如果 reviewer R4 质疑 \\\"no actual TTS improvement\\\"，+1.8pp 的回答只是 marginal  satisfactory。\\n\\n\\nSJ-based selection 的 +1.8pp gain 源自 rho=0.41 的不完美 ranking：SJ 能识别出 roughly 15%  的 oracle headroom。这个 gain 是 real 但 modest 的原因：(1) rho=0.41 意味着 SJ ranking  和 actual accuracy ranking 只有 moderate agreement；(2) 很多 high-SJ instance 本身已经接近  greedy performance（ceiling effect）；(3) low-SJ instance 中确实有 bad samples 但 greedy  就是比任何 sample 好（model confidence 准确时 greedy > stochastic）。FK 的 +1.0pp 更弱， 因为 FK 的 lower rho（0.29）意味着更差的 ranking ability。SJ>FK gain 仅 0.8pp， reviewer 会质疑这是否 justify 使用更复杂的 structured metric。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ner_multi_model\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B on SciERC NER，验证 effect 跨模型泛化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"finetune_ner_f1\": 0.635,\n      \"finetune_train_loss\": 0.088,\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.601,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.748,\n      \"headroom\": 0.147,\n      \"rho_sj_full\": 0.35,\n      \"rho_fk_full\": 0.28,\n      \"sj_minus_fk_full\": 0.07,\n      \"rho_sj_cond\": 0.36,\n      \"rho_fk_cond\": 0.27,\n      \"n_full\": 529,\n      \"n_cond\": 495,\n      \"p_sj_full\": 8.4e-17,\n      \"sample_f1_mean\": 0.52,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 16.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-model comparison on SciERC NER (N=8)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Qwen3-8B\",\n          \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Greedy F1\",\n            0.667,\n            0.601\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n            0.41,\n            0.35\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n            0.29,\n            0.28\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ - FK delta\",\n            \"+12pp\",\n            \"+7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle F1\",\n            0.789,\n            0.748\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Headroom\",\n            0.122,\n            0.147\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-model 结果 addresses R2 concern 但不是 strong refutation。SJ>FK 的方向一致  是 positive signal，但 delta 从 12→7pp 和 rho 从 0.41→0.35 的下降留下了 \\\"效果  是否 robust across stronger/weaker models\\\" 的疑问。如果有 budget，加一个 70B model  或 GPT-4-class model 会更有说服力，但 P1 优先级下 8B-class 两个 model 是合理 scope。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 的 SciERC fine-tune 比 Qwen3-8B 弱（greedy F1 0.60 vs 0.67），因为  LLaMA 的 instruction following 和 structured output 能力不如 Qwen3。rho_sj=0.35  低于 Qwen 的 0.41，但 SJ>FK 的 advantage 依然显著（+7pp），说明 \\\"structural metric  优于 surface metric\\\" 这个 finding 是 model-agnostic 的。rho 较低的原因：LLaMA 的  lower baseline performance 意味着更多 instance 处于 \\\"inability\\\" 区间（all-zero 比例  更高），这些 instance dilute 了 overall correlation。SJ>FK delta 从 12pp 降至 7pp  也符合预期：weaker model 的 output 更 noisy，SJ 的 structural sensitivity 优势被  noise 部分抵消。作为 model-agnosticism 的 evidence 是 sufficient 但不 compelling。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"re_n16_confirmation\",\n    \"description\": \"RE N=16 on SciERC 确认 negative finding\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.4208,\n      \"oracle_f1_n16\": 0.625,\n      \"headroom_n16\": 0.204,\n      \"rho_sj_full_n16\": 0.26,\n      \"rho_fk_full_n16\": 0.29,\n      \"rho_sj_cond_n16\": 0.33,\n      \"rho_fk_cond_n16\": 0.3,\n      \"sj_beats_fk_full\": false,\n      \"sj_beats_fk_cond\": true,\n      \"n_full\": 397,\n      \"n_cond\": 305,\n      \"all_zero_count\": 92,\n      \"pct_zero_samples\": 42.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: RE N-scaling comparison on SciERC\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"N=8 (pilot_004)\",\n          \"N=16\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (full)\",\n            0.2441,\n            0.26\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_fk (full)\",\n            0.2782,\n            0.29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_sj (cond)\",\n            0.3161,\n            0.33\n          ],\n          [\n            \"rho_fk (cond)\",\n            0.3067,\n            0.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ beats FK (full)\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ beats FK (cond)\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"All-zero instances\",\n            84,\n            92\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RE N=16 的 marginal improvement 完美 confirms Claim 2：compound error propagation  是 structural bottleneck，不是 sample size problem。论文中可以直接写 \\\"increasing N  from 8 to 16 yields negligible improvement in RE full-set correlation (+0.016),  confirming that the degradation is fundamental rather than statistical\\\"。 Conditional rho=0.33 is a valid but modest signal，需要 caveat about threshold sensitivity。\\n\\n\\nRE N=16 的 full rho_sj=0.26 vs N=8 的 0.244，提升极小（+0.016），因为 RE 的 fundamental  problem（compound error propagation）不会因为 more samples 而缓解——16 个 samples 产生的  span-level SJ 仍然无法区分 \\\"model 不确定 head entity\\\" vs \\\"model 不确定 relation type\\\"  vs \\\"model 根本不知道这个 relation\\\"。Conditional rho=0.33 在 median range 内（[0.28, 0.36]）， 比 N=8 的 0.316 略好，但 \\\"fuzzy boundary\\\" 的 caveat 明显——conditional set 的划分依赖  all-zero threshold，不同 threshold 会得到不同结果。SJ 在 full set 仍然输给 FK（0.26 vs 0.29）， 而 conditional set 上 SJ 小幅领先（0.33 vs 0.30），这个 pattern 与 N=8 一致， confirms the diagnostic finding with higher statistical power。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"capability_stratification\",\n    \"description\": \"按 difficulty strata 分析 rho 变化（NER + RE）\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ner_strata\": {\n        \"high_f1_gt_08\": {\n          \"n\": 185,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.14\n        },\n        \"medium_f1_04_08\": {\n          \"n\": 212,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.44\n        },\n        \"low_f1_lt_04\": {\n          \"n\": 132,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.22\n        }\n      },\n      \"re_strata\": {\n        \"high_f1_gt_06\": {\n          \"n\": 88,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.12\n        },\n        \"medium_f1_02_06\": {\n          \"n\": 135,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.31\n        },\n        \"low_f1_lt_02\": {\n          \"n\": 174,\n          \"rho_sj\": 0.16\n        }\n      },\n      \"ner_peak_stratum\": \"medium (0.4-0.8)\",\n      \"re_peak_stratum\": \"medium (0.2-0.6)\",\n      \"boundary_sharpness\": \"fuzzy — 10-15pp overlap between strata CIs\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: NER rho_sj by difficulty stratum\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Stratum\",\n          \"F1 range\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"rho_sj\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Easy\",\n            \">0.8\",\n            185,\n            0.14,\n            \"[0.02, 0.26]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Medium\",\n            \"0.4-0.8\",\n            212,\n            0.44,\n            \"[0.33, 0.54]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hard\",\n            \"<0.4\",\n            132,\n            0.22,\n            \"[0.06, 0.38]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: RE rho_sj by difficulty stratum\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Stratum\",\n          \"F1 range\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"rho_sj\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Easy\",\n            \">0.6\",\n            88,\n            0.12,\n            \"[-0.09, 0.32]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Medium\",\n            \"0.2-0.6\",\n            135,\n            0.31,\n            \"[0.16, 0.45]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hard\",\n            \"<0.2\",\n            174,\n            0.16,\n            \"[0.02, 0.30]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Inverted-U pattern 是 strongest analytical finding：明确解释了 \\\"为什么 overall rho 只有  0.41——因为 easy 和 hard instances dilute the signal\\\"。Medium stratum 的 rho=0.44（NER） 说明 SJ 在 sweet spot 上的 discriminative power 是合理的。但 fuzzy boundaries 限制了  practical guidance 的 precision——论文不能说 \\\"只在 F1 0.4-0.8 的 instance 上用 SJ\\\"， 因为 you don't know F1 at test time。这个分析是 diagnostic contribution 的核心， 但需要 honest framing about the boundary fuzziness。\\n\\n\\nrho 呈现 inverted-U 形状的原因：High stratum（easy instances）的 F1 和 SJ 都高且 variance 低， ceiling effect 压缩了 rank 差异；Low stratum（hard instances）的 model 基本 fail， SJ 接近 random，无 discriminative power。只有 Medium stratum 同时有足够 variance 和  genuine uncertainty，使 SJ 能 discriminate。但在 median tier 下 boundary 是 fuzzy 的： strata 之间的 rho CI 大幅重叠（bootstrap CI width ~0.08-0.12），无法画出 clean cutoff。 RE 的 pattern 更极端——Low stratum 极大（n=174），反映 model capability 的 fundamental  限制。这支持 Claim 2 但需要 \\\"the boundary is fuzzy\\\" 的 caveat。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"selection_curves\",\n    \"description\": \"Best-of-N selection curves (N=1,2,4,8,16) for SJ vs FK vs random\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"curves_sj\": {\n        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n        \"n2\": 0.672,\n        \"n4\": 0.678,\n        \"n8\": 0.683,\n        \"n16\": 0.685\n      },\n      \"curves_fk\": {\n        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n        \"n2\": 0.67,\n        \"n4\": 0.674,\n        \"n8\": 0.676,\n        \"n16\": 0.677\n      },\n      \"curves_rand\": {\n        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n        \"n2\": 0.669,\n        \"n4\": 0.671,\n        \"n8\": 0.673,\n        \"n16\": 0.674\n      },\n      \"curves_oracle\": {\n        \"n1\": 0.6671,\n        \"n2\": 0.71,\n        \"n4\": 0.745,\n        \"n8\": 0.776,\n        \"n16\": 0.789\n      },\n      \"sj_fk_gap_at_n16\": 0.008,\n      \"sj_fk_gap_at_n8\": 0.007\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这张图的问题是 SJ/FK/random 三条线 visually 太接近，只有 inset/zoom 才能看到差异。 Oracle curve 远在上方，强调了 selection 的 headroom 还很大。最佳 framing： \\\"SJ consistently outperforms alternatives, but current correlation levels limit headroom  capture to ~15%\\\"。作为 P2 visualization，informative 但不 critical for acceptance。\\n\\n\\nSelection curves 显示 SJ 在所有 N 上 consistently outperform FK 和 random，但 gap  modest：N=16 时 SJ vs FK 仅 0.8pp。Curves 都呈现 diminishing returns，与 oracle curve  的 gap 在 N 增大时反而 widen——说明 more samples 主要增加了 oracle ceiling（more diverse  outputs to choose from），但 SJ 的 selection ability 没有 proportionally 提升。 SJ-FK gap 随 N 微增（从 N=4 的 0.4pp 到 N=16 的 0.8pp），因为 more samples 让 SJ  的 structural comparison 更 stable。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ner_ood_robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"OntoNotes 域内 vs 域外 NER consistency signal 鲁棒性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"in_domain_rho_sj\": 0.29,\n      \"ood_rho_sj\": 0.24,\n      \"in_domain_greedy_f1\": 0.583,\n      \"ood_greedy_f1\": 0.51,\n      \"ood_sj_minus_fk\": 0.02,\n      \"ood_rho_fk\": 0.22,\n      \"ood_n\": \"~1200\",\n      \"ood_pct_zero\": 22.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: In-domain vs OOD on OntoNotes NER\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Setting\",\n          \"Greedy F1\",\n          \"rho_sj\",\n          \"rho_fk\",\n          \"SJ-FK\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"In-domain (nw)\",\n            0.583,\n            0.29,\n            0.26,\n            \"+3pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OOD (bc/wb)\",\n            0.51,\n            0.24,\n            0.22,\n            \"+2pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OOD 结果是 median tier 的 additional risk factor。与 OntoNotes in-domain 的弱结果叠加， 叙事被进一步压缩。但也提供了额外 analysis angle：systematic vs random error 对 consistency  signal 的不同影响。论文中作为 \\\"limitations & future work\\\" section 的 content 是 appropriate， 但不能作为 positive contribution。P2 优先级下如果时间紧可以 cut。\\n\\nOOD 的 rho 从 in-domain 的 0.29 降至 0.24，因为 domain shift 引入了 systematic error  pattern 而非 random uncertainty——model 在 OOD domain 上 consistently 犯同类错误（e.g.,  新闻训练的 model 在 broadcast/weblog 上 systematically miss informal entity mentions）， 这种 systematic error 产生 high consistency（samples 一致地错）但 low accuracy， 破坏了 SJ-accuracy correlation。SJ>FK 仅 2pp，在 practical 意义上可忽略。 这进一步收窄了 SJ 的 applicable scope：不仅受 type granularity 影响，还受 domain match 影响。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":777,"startLine":1,"totalLines":777}}}
